 97	The next two lemmas show that the CL functions $L_{\mathsf{Point}}$, $L_{\mathsf{ALine}}$, $L_{\mathsf{DLine}}$ give rise to the axis-parallel and diagonal line-versus-point distributions.
 98	We label the coordinates by $r\in\{0,\ldots,m-1\}$, with label $r$
 99	representing the paper's coordinate $r+1$.
